@startuml cicd_registry_deploy_diagram
title Design Pattern Playground - CI/CD and private registry flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

node "Developer machine" as Dev
cloud "GitHub" as GitHub {
  artifact "Git repository\nmain / pull requests" as Repo
  node "GitHub Actions" as Actions {
    node "backend job\n./mvnw test" as JobBackend
    node "frontend job\nnpm run build" as JobFrontend
    node "compose job\ndocker compose config" as JobCompose
    node "publish job\nbuildx + push" as JobPublish
    node "deploy job\nssh + rsync + deploy_prod.sh" as JobDeploy
  }
}

node "VPS" as VPS {
  node "Private Docker Registry" as Registry
  node "Application deployment" as Prod
}

Dev --> Repo : push / PR
Repo --> JobBackend
Repo --> JobFrontend
Repo --> JobCompose

JobBackend --> JobPublish : needs success
JobFrontend --> JobPublish : needs success
JobCompose --> JobPublish : needs success

JobPublish --> Registry : docker login\nbuild backend/frontend\npush tags sha + main

JobPublish --> JobDeploy : on push main\nor workflow_dispatch
JobDeploy --> VPS : SSH
JobDeploy --> Prod : rsync repo\nupload .env\nAPP_IMAGE_TAG=${GITHUB_SHA}\n./scripts/deploy_prod.sh
Prod --> Registry : docker login + pull images

note right of JobPublish
Secrets utilises :
- REGISTRY_HOST
- REGISTRY_NAMESPACE
- REGISTRY_USERNAME
- REGISTRY_PASSWORD
end note

note right of JobDeploy
Secrets utilises :
- VPS_SSH_*
- VPS_APP_DIR
- PROD_ENV_FILE
end note

note bottom of Prod
Le VPS ne build plus les images applicatives.
Il recupere les images depuis la registry privee.
end note

@enduml
